description.content:
**Example Request**

    GET /api/dashboard/v1/programs/{enterprise_uuid}/

**Parameters**

* `enterprise_uuid`: UUID of an enterprise customer.

**Example Response**

    [
        {
            "uuid": "ff41a5eb-2a73-4933-8e80-a1c66068ed2c",
